grammar webster
records entry
node entry group as entry
node headword text as headword trim
node form text as form
node pos text as pos
node domain text as domain
node etymology_text text as etymology_text trim
node etymology_fragment text as etymology_fragment
node note text as note
node usage text as usage
node text text as text trim
node crossref text as crossref
node other text as other
node synonym text as synonym trim
node syn_mark skip
node blank skip
node preface skip
